## A lantern in the snow

@narrator{code="0010"}: The last hound drops something as it flees: a lantern, cracked, with a single star inside.
@lumi{code="0010" emotion="surprised"}: That's Nell! She lived next to me! She owes me a comet!
@narrator{code="0020"}: The glass breaks. A pinprick of light shoots up and sticks to the sky.
@aria{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: Nine thousand nine hundred and... well. One more.
@lumi{code="0020"}: The keep's past the mountains. The road there isn't open yet. We'll need a lot more stars.
